# An X session on Dolly's display: the Xsdl server, twm managing the
# windows, and three of X's own clients in theirs: a clock, eyes that follow
# the pointer and a terminal with a shell, where imgui-x11 starts Dear ImGui's
# example in a window of its own.
FROM /v0.1.4/Dollyfile-system c2cbab2b18d89d756a8ec3f6554a5c85072a097848f355d2d592984d2a326357
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xorg-server db5bbf6ec52fdd147e370ebc9448e58abff1dda66740d9565f56de490a0f987a
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-twm bd86d8a96e2e6a9ff8d120348bb8d1497e29c487de6d7b7f1958e826966d9d96
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xclock 1768b1b50aed6b89f850c4fa054cd1630f4f94b1ae776e146f1978c7499d5d58
INSTALL /v0.1.4/demos/x11/Dollyfile-xeyes 36032df74f029ee3f7b39947d92b14870ff67d8ae203f079ae4fd1f71e561cb3
